    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Worldview]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, cockroaches will continue to evolve, and we may have to use special methods to exterminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you set traps for the cockroaches that inhabit various stages and exterminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Description]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls a robot that exterminates cockroaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>This robot can release two things: a liquid that cockroaches dislike, and a trap to exterminate them.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The player scatters the liquid to narrow the cockroach's movement range,</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>set the trap, and wait for the cockroach to get caught.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of traps that can be set in each stage is limited, and they must be exterminated within the time limit.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Worldview]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, cockroaches will continue to evolve, and we may have to use special methods to exterminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you set traps for the cockroaches that inhabit various stages and exterminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Description]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls a robot that exterminates cockroaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>This robot can release two things: a liquid that cockroaches dislike, and a trap to exterminate them.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The player scatters the liquid to narrow the cockroach's movement range,</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>set the trap, and wait for the cockroach to get caught.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of traps that can be set in each stage is limited, and they must be exterminated within the time limit.</p>",
    "short_description": "An action game where you set traps and exterminate cockroaches!",
